17. Configure automatic cleanup

The database has:

public.cleanup_expired_rooms()

The README recommends running that periodically.

In Supabase, configure a scheduled job/pg_cron to execute:

select public.cleanup_expired_rooms();

Every 15–60 minutes is reasonable.

This means:

Expired room
     ↓
cleanup job
     ↓
deleted

Even without the cleanup job, expired rooms are supposed to be excluded from normal reads.

